{
  "id": "dowtherm_a",
  "title": "Dowtherm A",
  "description": "Physical properties of Dowtherm A heat transfer fluid. DOWTHERM™ A is a eutectic mixture of biphenyl and diphenyl oxide, suitable for non-pressurized liquid phase systems with a maximum temperature of 550 °F (288 °C).",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Dowtherm A Properties\n\nDOWTHERM™ A is a eutectic mixture of:\n- **Biphenyl** (C₁₂H₁₀)\n- **Diphenyl oxide** (C₁₂H₁₀O)\n\n### Operating Range\n- **Liquid phase:** 15 °C to 400 °C (60 °F to 750 °F)\n- **Vapor phase:** 257 °C to 400 °C (495 °F to 750 °F)\n\n### Key Physical Properties\n- **Freeze point:** 12 °C (56.6 °F)\n- **Boiling point (atmospheric):** 257 °C (494.8 °F)\n- **Flash point (SETA):** 113 °C (236 °F)\n- **Fire point (C.O.C):** 118 °C (245 °F)\n- **Autoignition temperature:** 599 °C (1110 °F)\n- **Density (at 25 °C/75 °F):** 1056 kg/m³ (66 lb/ft³)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_c",
          "label": "Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "density_offset",
          "label": "Density Adjustment Factor",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "temperature_f",
          "label": "Temperature",
          "unit": "°F",
          "formula": "inputs.temperature_c * 9/5 + 32",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "density",
          "label": "Estimated Density",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "formula": "1056 - (inputs.temperature_c - 25) * 0.72 + inputs.density_offset",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "density_lbft3",
          "label": "Estimated Density",
          "unit": "lb/ft³",
          "formula": "(1056 - (inputs.temperature_c - 25) * 0.72 + inputs.density_offset) / 16.018",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Temperature (°C)",
        "Temperature (°F)",
        "Typical Density (kg/m³)",
        "Typical Density (lb/ft³)",
        "Application"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          15,
          59,
          1070,
          66.8,
          "Minimum liquid phase"
        ],
        [
          25,
